    "body": "I would slightly prefer to save the global object, and then use \"_global_'s relevant realm\".\r\n\r\nOtherwise, we're technically accessing _offscreenCanvas_ in parallel, which is bad. Accessing a global object is also bad, but it's more obvious that it's one of the \"special\" objects that we make an exception for...",
