    "body": "I think there's a case to be made for porting (some much shorter version of) https://github.com/w3c/ServiceWorker/pull/1755#issuecomment-2661941708 into the spec, to acknowledge the messy reality and carve out some clearer exceptions. But that's a more ambitious followup, I think.",
